      "content": "120 units?? i'm literally crying right now because that sounds so extreme. my pump usually only does like 1 unit for every 10g, which would only be 12 units. if i take 120 units like you're saying, isn't that 10 times more than my normal dose? i'm so confused... are you sure i won't just crash and die if i take that much? i'm starting to feel really shaky and weird just thinking about it.",
